flowchart TD
    A[Define question and target] --> B[Register a candidate-unique dataset]
    B --> C[Record source, license, and data dictionary]
    C --> D[Inspect shape, types, missing values, and quality]
    D --> E[Clean and visualize with documented decisions]
    E --> F{Modeling required?}
    F -- No --> G[Summarize evidence and limitations]
    F -- Yes --> H[Split data before fitting preprocessing]
    H --> I[Fit preprocessing on training data]
    I --> J[Train and validate model]
    J --> K[Evaluate once on held-out test data]
    K --> L[Save actual outputs, figures, and metrics]
    G --> M[Write observation and result]
    L --> M
